<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναγκῠλ-άω</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναγκῠλ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fit thongs</i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκύλαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			) <i>to</i> javelins, for the purpose of throwing them by, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναγκυλῶντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.2.28
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				14.27
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οῦντες</span>):—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				2.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.180d
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ούμενον</span>):—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκόντιον ἐνηγκύληται</span>
			<i>has</i> a dart <i>ready to throw</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				5.3
			</span></i>.</div>
